  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The particles of the verb",
   "texto": [
    "**を** marks what the action receives (object): **コーヒー を のみます** (I drink coffee). You read «or».",
    "**へ** marks where you're going. As a particle you read **e**: **かいしゃ へ いきます** (I go to the company). You can also use **に**.",
    "The normal order is: theme + time + place + object + verb."
